            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Seems like a bug in `glob2regpat`/`file_pat_to_reg_pat`. It converts the `foo{2..10}` into `/foo[2-10]$`. The issue is regex `[2-10]` is the range `2-1` (invalid end index) plus the character `0`. Numeric ranges in regex are just [lovely](https://www.regular-expressions.info/numericranges.html).\n\nMaybe we could just keep it as a glob, but that leaves the bug in `glob2regpat`.",
